## Getting Started

### Prerequisites

- Node.js 18+
- {{#if_eq packageManager "npm"}}npm{{/if_eq}}{{#if_eq packageManager "yarn"}}yarn{{/if_eq}}{{#if_eq packageManager "pnpm"}}pnpm{{/if_eq}} package manager

### Installation

```bash
{{#if_eq packageManager "npm"}}npm install{{/if_eq}}{{#if_eq packageManager "yarn"}}yarn install{{/if_eq}}{{#if_eq packageManager "pnpm"}}pnpm install{{/if_eq}}
```

### Development

Run the development server:

```bash
{{#if_eq packageManager "npm"}}npm run dev{{/if_eq}}{{#if_eq packageManager "yarn"}}yarn dev{{/if_eq}}{{#if_eq packageManager "pnpm"}}pnpm dev{{/if_eq}}
```

The API server will be running on [http://localhost:{{port}}](http://localhost:{{port}})

### Build

Build for production:

```bash
{{#if_eq packageManager "npm"}}npm run build{{/if_eq}}{{#if_eq packageManager "yarn"}}yarn build{{/if_eq}}{{#if_eq packageManager "pnpm"}}pnpm build{{/if_eq}}
```

### Start Production Server

```bash
{{#if_eq packageManager "npm"}}npm start{{/if_eq}}{{#if_eq packageManager "yarn"}}yarn start{{/if_eq}}{{#if_eq packageManager "pnpm"}}pnpm start{{/if_eq}}
```

